          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "Zelda",
          "role": "inscription"
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "Then wear the gold hat, if that will move her;",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 4,
          "text": "If you can bounce high, bounce for her too,",
          "role": "verse"
        },
        {
